ćom. Biti u svakom momentu što je moguće viši na prstima i opružen i bez rotacija u gornjem delu, grudi izbačene. Tokom podizanja noge snažna rotacija u stranu noge koja se podiže. Prepone razmaknute 4-5 stopa.","short_note":null,"note":null,"image_url":"https://drive.google.com/uc?id=102GKufTq_6NCNL_Temsq7tQaM2-nLQoS","video_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1BOn2YNvEa4eD4HPC83rWUWKdUeaZhZsh/view?usp=drive_link","sets":"1","reps":"1+1","load":null,"item_order":"4","exercise_order":"4","source_row_ref":"413","domain_name":null,"category_name":"General Prep","section_name":"Hurdle mobility","domain_color":null,"category_color":"#a4c2f4","section_color":"#b6d7a8","domain_icon_url":null,"category_icon_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1c9jBrmpSHHKcYbsRsIYs_gDM6XkYN7UO/view?usp=drive_link","section_icon_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DDD6yyHoZoH4KgZ2CCvrZlhh4kW016ey/view?usp=drive_link","domain_short_note":null,"category_short_note":null,"section_short_note":null,"domain_note":null,"category_note":null,"section_note":null,"domain_order":null,"category_order":"2","section_order":"2","exercise_key_type":"code","exercise_key":"992","exercise_expected_name":"Prelasci unapred hodom preko prepona (jedna noga napada) - akvavreća iznad glave se rotira"},{"plan_source_ref":"pankov-cleaned-2026-08-18:weekly:2026-07-13","date":"2026-07-17","session_order":"2","node_type":"section","node_name":"Activation","node_order":"5","item_type":"exercise","title":"Bočna kretanja sa promenama pravca - bočni udaci akvavrećom","description":"Kretati se što je moguće brže sa udarcem sa strane akvavrećom u momentu kontakta. Izbaciti grudi tokom udarca vrećom. Izazvati što je moguće jači zvuk.","short_note":null,"note":null,"image_url":"https://drive.google.com/uc?id=1vQbOlEF3T4LT2uGzcAi6qtBSeKlkqGW2","video_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1n9xeF1ZWAKj8M4hygzhyXcIAalt4EwXB/view?usp=sharing","sets":"2","reps":"3+3","load":null,"item_order":"4","exercise_order":"4","source_row_